# Agent skills installed via `npx skills add`. These are third-party files that
# land inside the repo, and they are tooling for whoever is editing the site, not
# part of the site itself. Ignored so a routine `git add -A` cannot sweep someone
# else's code into this repo. (site/.claude/launch.json IS tracked on purpose.)
.claude/skills/
.agents/skills/
skills-lock.json

